<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
How Much Are the Celtics Paying Mike Conley in 2026-27?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Conley earns <strong>$3.88m</strong> in 2026-27 on a veteran minimum deal. He’s seventh on the <a href="/teams/boston-celtics/">Boston</a> payroll, behind four players who weren’t in the league when he signed his first contract.</p>
<p>He’s been paid <strong>$302.63m</strong> across 20 seasons, which is the most of anyone in the squad apart from <a href="/players/paul-george/">Paul George</a>. This year he takes up <strong>1.95%</strong> of Boston’s <strong>$198.72m</strong> payroll, so the club has a 20-year veteran for under two cents in every dollar it spends.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-152 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="salary_sources">
