<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/mike-conley/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/mike-conley/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Celtics Paying Mike Conley in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conley earns $3.88m in 2026-27 on a veteran minimum deal. He’s seventh on the Boston payroll, behind four players who weren’t in the league when he signed his first contract. He’s been paid $302.63m across 20 seasons, which is the most of anyone in the squad apart from Paul George. This year he takes up 1.95% of Boston’s $198.72m payroll, so the club has a 20-year veteran for under two cents in every dollar it spends."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Mike Conley Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conley's contract expires after this season and he becomes a free agent in the summer of 2027 at the age of 39. At this stage every deal is a one-year decision on both sides, and the question is usually whether the player wants another season, because a club will always offer one."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Mike Conley Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $3.88m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Mike Conley’s Contract Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conley signed with Boston as a free agent on July 6, 2026, a one-year veteran minimum contract worth $3.88m and fully guaranteed. It’s the seventh contract of his career and the smallest since his rookie deal ended in 2011. The minimum is set by the league and scales with years of service. A 20-year veteran costs his club less than the figure suggests, because the league covers part of it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Mike Conley Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conley’s net worth is estimated at around $121m. No outlet publishes a figure for him, so that’s worked back from career earnings of $302.63m. Tax takes close to half of gross pay before agent fees and escrow, and he’s earned in Tennessee, Utah, Minnesota and now Massachusetts, which vary widely. His peak years paid above $26m for five straight seasons from 2016-17, so the bulk of it arrived in a concentrated stretch in his late twenties and early thirties."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Mike Conley Paid $3.88m?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Conley is on the minimum because the market prices what a player will give you next season, and at 39 nineteen previous ones count for very little. Boston gets a 20-year veteran for less than it pays several of its rookies."}}]}</script>
